<title>GERMANY: AMB -H1 net profit 131 mln dmk vs 126 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>AMB -H1 net profit 131 mln dmk vs 126 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>AACHEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   131     vs 126</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     176     vs 171</p>
<p>    Group premium income		     8,900   vs 8,600</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Aachener und Muenchener Beteiligungs AG (AMB). The group reiterated its forecast for an unchanged dividend for 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
